From: Yoonji Park <koreapyj@dcmys.kr>
Subject: [PATCH] common: add shared QMI, SMS, PDC, voice and WDS helpers

Add the code shared between the uqmi command line tool and uqmid to the
common library:

- qmi-message: separate encode and decode buffers, so data returned by a
  parser stays valid while the next request is built, and no abort() on
  buffer overflow
- qmi-errors: build the error table once as part of the generated
  library instead of including it in every user
- qmi-frame: QMUX frame parsing and debug dump helpers
- sms_part, charsets: SMS PDU codec following ModemManager, including
  alphanumeric destination addresses
- pdc-util, sha1: PDC configuration id and type helpers
- voice-util, voice-parse, wds-util: name tables of the VOICE and WDS
  services and the All Call Status parser
- ext-fmt: JSON forms of replies without a ModemManager equivalent
- service definitions: PDC, VOICE (including supplementary services and
  call end reasons) and the WDS P-CSCF address lists, taken from libqmi

Host tests of the helpers live in common/test (not part of the build).
---
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ ENDIF()
 
 SET(service_headers)
 SET(service_sources)
-FOREACH(service ctl dms nas pds wds wms wda uim)
+FOREACH(service ctl dms nas pds wds wms wda uim pdc voice)
 	ADD_CUSTOM_COMMAND(
 		OUTPUT  qmi-message-${service}.h
 		COMMAND ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/data/gen-header.pl ${service}_ ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/data/qmi-service-${service}.json > qmi-message-${service}.h
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@ ADD_CUSTOM_TARGET(gen-errors DEPENDS qmi-errors.c)
 ADD_CUSTOM_TARGET(gen-headers DEPENDS ${service_headers})
 
 INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES(common ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR})
-ADD_LIBRARY(qmigen ${service_sources})
+ADD_LIBRARY(qmigen ${service_sources} ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/qmi-errors.c)
 ADD_DEPENDENCIES(qmigen gen-headers gen-errors)
 
 ADD_SUBDIRECTORY(common)
--- a/common/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/common/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 
-SET(COMMON_SOURCES qmi-message.c mbim.c utils.c)
+SET(COMMON_SOURCES qmi-message.c mbim.c utils.c sha1.c sms_part.c charsets.c qmi-frame.c pdc-util.c voice-util.c voice-parse.c wds-util.c ext-fmt.c)
 
 ADD_LIBRARY(common ${COMMON_SOURCES})
 ADD_DEPENDENCIES(common gen-headers gen-errors)
