+ * Raw QMI WDS tables and helpers shared by the uqmi CLI and uqmid: ip-family / pdp-type / auth names,
+ * the A2 MUX (BAM-DMUX) SIO data port, IPv4/IPv6 address strings and netmask -> prefix length.
+ * No control flow of either side, no talloc/ubus here.
